# MUNI STAIRS RAIL and the goal Grind a Handrail at Harvey Milk Plaza ("Respect the plaza. Mind the
# Muni riders."): a full ollie onto the middle handrail at the top (it starts 1.1 m above the plaza,
# so the pop comes 2 m early) and a 50-50 to the bottom, 16.3 m and 7 m down, off at 11.4 m/s.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -590.525 -30.458 19.500 -121.69
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x -4.2543
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -2.6270
hold ollie 67..97
tap grind 104
tap grind 110
tap grind 116
tap grind 122
tap grind 128
tap grind 134
tap grind 140
tap grind 146
tap grind 152
bot balance
run 560
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=rail_-596_-34} within 150..154
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 411..415
expect event gap{id=muni_rail,gap=MUNI STAIRS RAIL,points=600} within 411..415
expect event goalComplete{id=harveyrail,name=Grind a Handrail at Harvey Milk Plaza,area=Castro} within 411..415
expect event land{quality=clean} within 480..484
expect no event gap{id=harvey_set}
expect no event bail
